# Eucalyptus melliodora A.Cunn. ex Schauer (Yellow Box)
# Taxon concept, anatomical subsystems (PO:*), pipe-model & biophysical allometry,
# InstanceState64 ontogenetic parameter bounds, ecological interactions (RO:*),
# and South-Eastern Australian Biocultural Country provenance (SPC / Local Contexts).
#
# Evidence boundary (per tree-cases.md):
# Taxonomic, morphological, and biophysical traits below represent sourced working
# reference bounds across the NSW and Victorian tablelands/western slopes grassy
# woodland range (Critically Endangered White Box-Yellow Box-Blakely's Red Gum
# Grassy Woodland community). Exact site and individual occurrence remain pending.

