    rdfs:comment "Country attribution spans Wiradjuri, Ngunnawal, Kamilaroi/Gamilaraay, Dja Dja Wurrung, Taungurung, and Yorta Yorta Nations across NSW and Victoria tablelands, slopes, and grassy woodlands. Local Contexts TK/BC notices record biocultural provenance without asserting community-authored TK labels absent direct First Nations co-design."@en .
